## Requirements

* The .NET 8 SDK -- [dotnet.microsoft.com/download](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download)
* `dotnet build` works offline; `dotnet test` restores xUnit from NuGet on
  first run, which needs network access

## Use

```sh
dotnet build {{ class_name }}.sln -c Release
dotnet test  {{ class_name }}.sln -c Release
dotnet run --project src/{{ class_name }}
dotnet run --project src/{{ class_name }} -- 1 2 3
```

MakeMaker can drive these for you:

```sh
makemaker build .
makemaker test .
makemaker run .
```

