## Notes

`Greeter.cs` holds the logic and `Program.cs` is a thin shell over it, so
`dotnet test` exercises real behaviour without touching the console. The app
project sets `TreatWarningsAsErrors`, which keeps the build honest from day
one -- relax it if that gets in your way.
